<title>USA: TABLE - Wm. Wrigley Jr Co Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Wm. Wrigley Jr Co Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.66		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			 76,647		   57,043</p>
<p> Revs		     525,273		  486,933</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 115,961		  115,975</p>
<p>	  SIX  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.20		    $0.99</p>
<p> Net			139,496		  114,656</p>
<p> Revs		     976,436		  916,788</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 115,959		  115,981</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 net includes charge related to closing of Santa Cruz factory of just over $1 million.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 net includes charge of $11 million, or $0.10 a share, for factory closings.</p>
<p>Six months 1997 net was lowered by just more than $2 million from factory closure and related costs vs a reduction of just over $11 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
